      "start_line": 36,
      "text": "  rule prefixFilter(P:IntSeq, sCons(S:IntSeq, REST:StrList))\n    => vCons(str(S), prefixFilter(P, REST))\n    requires startsWith(P, S) ==Bool true\n    [simplification]"
    },
